WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.591
Every single night, the lonely boy desperately wished he could completely stop time.

2
00:00:05.591 --> 00:00:11.375
Then one miraculous day, his deepest wish finally came true across the quiet room.

3
00:00:11.375 --> 00:00:16.896
He could suddenly freeze everything around him including falling rain and people in tracks.

4
00:00:16.896 --> 00:00:22.536
At the very beginning, he felt powerful and invincible like an absolute living god.

5
00:00:22.536 --> 00:00:28.320
He used his incredible power to easily avoid pain and escape every difficult problem.

6
00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:34.392
But slowly over time, he began to notice something deeply terrifying happening around him.

7
00:00:34.392 --> 00:00:40.536
Every single time time stopped, someone he truly loved forgot a precious memory forever.

8
00:00:40.536 --> 00:00:46.055
Desperate to fix everything, he stopped time one final time and whispered his truth.

9
00:00:46.055 --> 00:00:50.903
He let time flow again so he could finally stay present with them always.

10
00:00:50.903 --> 00:00:55.823
For the first time in his life, he happily chose to grow older together.
